<title>JAPAN: TIFFE says additional Euroyen futures suspended.</title>
<headline>TIFFE says additional Euroyen futures suspended.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading of the September 1998, December 1998, June 1999 and September 1999 Euroyen futures contracts was suspended on Tuesday due to system trouble, the Tokyo International Financial Futures Exchange (TIFFE) said in a statement.</p>
<p>TIFFE earlier announced that trade in the December 1997, March 1998, June 1998 and March 1999 Euroyen futures contracts had been suspended.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
